{"componentChunkName":"component---src-components-concept-jsx","path":"/metamorfismo-grado/grado-metamorfico-medio.html","result":{"pageContext":{"node":{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/metamorfismo-grado/grado-metamorfico-medio","type":"Concept","prefLabel":{"es":"grado metamórfico medio","en":"medium metamorphic grade"},"altLabel":null,"hiddenLabel":null,"definition":{"es":"Estructura del protolito típicamente obliterada. Incluye rocas metamorfizadas en facies de anfibolitas epidóticas de alta temperatura, anfibolitas de baja temperatura y eclogitas de baja temperatura. Asociaciones minerales según Fry (1984) Tabla 10-1: Material ultramáfico: olivino, talco (magnesita, antofilita); material ígneo básico, porción máfica: hornblenda, (diópsido, granate); porción calco-alumínica: plagioclase básica; material pelita y semi-pelita: mica blanca, biotita, cuarzo (granate, minerales alumínicos).","en":"Protolith structure typically obliterated. Includes rocks metamorphosed in high-temperature epidote-amphibolite, low-temperature amphibolite, and low temperature eclogite facies. Mineral assemblages according to Fry (1984) Table 10-1: ultramafic-olivine, talc (magnesite, anthophyllite), mafic-hornblende, (diopside, garnet), calc-aluminous basic-plagioclase, pelite, semi-pelite -- white mica, biotite, quartz (garnet, Al-minerals)."},"note":null,"changeNote":null,"editorialNote":null,"historyNote":null,"scopeNote":null,"notation":null,"example":null,"narrower":[],"narrowerTransitive":[],"broader":{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/metamorfismo-grado/grado-metamorfizado-no-especificado","prefLabel":{"es":"grado metamórfizado no especificado","en":"metamorphosed grade not specified"}},"broaderTransitive":null,"related":[],"relatedMatch":null,"broadMatch":null,"narrowMatch":null,"closeMatch":null,"exactMatch":[{"id":"http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/metamorphicgrade/medium_metamorphic_grade"}],"inScheme":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/